                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="13093633" author="ikelly" created="Tue, 30 Aug 2011 10:26:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Why not just check if the bookie.zk is null rather than adding another boolean flag? &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This would be better as there are cases where zk is never changed from null (testing cases, where zk isn&apos;t used and we communicate directly with the bookie). &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, Im not sure what you mean by recovery in this context. This is startup code. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13094412" author="leixu" created="Wed, 31 Aug 2011 10:12:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ivan, you are right, it is startup code, not recovery, my mistake.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13094414" author="leixu" created="Wed, 31 Aug 2011 10:18:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;new patch. check bookie.zk instead&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13094595" author="ikelly" created="Wed, 31 Aug 2011 15:00:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;+1.&lt;br/&gt;
committed as r1163655&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
